{
  "dom_id": "step-e9005",
  "name": "Example: Finding the Radius or Diameter of a Sphere Given Its Surface Area",
  "problem": "Calculate the radius of a sphere given that its surface area is $50\\pi \\: \\textrm{cm}^2.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14252847/assets/99bb0ea67859fbd109442fcf698427ea43452087b4523b7202a760a2a8b27052.png)",
  "worked_solution": "We can calculate the surface area of a sphere using the formula\n\n$$\nS = 4 \\pi r^2,\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the radius of the sphere.\n\nSubstituting $S=50\\pi \\: \\textrm{cm}^2$ into the formula, we can solve for $r$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}S & =4\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\ 50\\pi  & =4\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{50\\pi }{4\\pi } & ={r}^{2} \\\\ {r}^{2} & =\\frac{25}{2} \\\\ r & =\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\text{cm}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e9005\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding the Radius or Diameter of a Sphere Given Its Surface Area</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e9005\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\